name: sim.getObjectAssociatedWithScript
description: 
luaSynopsis: int objectHandle=sim.getObjectAssociatedWithScript (int scriptHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptHandle: handle of the script, or sim.handle_self for the handle of the current script
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the object that the script is associated with, or -1 if the script is not associated (e.g. main scripts or add-ons don't have associated objects).
